            <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">You can cast this spell before making any Injury Rolls for an attack made by the spellcaster. If you do so, add +1 INJURY DICE to all of the Injury Rolls you make for the attack. For example, if the attack has the BLAST Keyword, you would add +1 INJURY DICE to the rolls for each model that was caught in the blast radius of the attack.</characteristic>
