              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="3f15-74a1-4d35-3642">Equipment</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="2b32-2f45-9c06-7a77"/>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496"/>
                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">An Entropital Dermis confers a -1 INJURY DICE to Injury Rolls made against this Model. Enemy Models cannot retreat from a model wearing the Entropital Dermis, and are considered to be engaged in melee with the wearer from 3” away instead of 1”. The wearer and any Model it is engaged with must still be within 1” of each other to perform a Melee attack (Including an Attack of Opportunity).</characteristic>
