                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">This equipment is treated as an upgrade that cannot be removed once purchased. When this upgrade is purchased you may choose to remove a scar from this Model. Additionally any time you roll 3 or more 6’s on exploration (after exploration skills like Set Dice or Rerolls have been accounted for), you may choose to pay 1 Glory to remove 1 scar from this Model.</characteristic>
