                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496"/>
                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">Always takes one hand to use in both melee and in ranged combat. Grants -1 to all injury rolls against the model. This bonus stacks with any armour the model wears, unless otherwise indicated. Any attack against this model that has the Keyword FIRE will suffer -1 DICE on injury rolls and will not cause an additional BLOOD MARKER.</characteristic>
