                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496"/>
                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">You must take a Cast Spell ACTION with the spellcaster in order for it to cast this spell. If you do so, if the next ACTION the spellcaster takes as part of this Activation requires one or more Success Rolls or Risky Success Rolls for any part of it, the first roll is automatically a Success (do not roll any dice)</characteristic>
